    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85233" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ̆πον-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, of
		men, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>much-labouring,
				much-suffering,</i> as a general epith. of mankind, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἄνδρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					1.33
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροτοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					382
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				175
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ωτάτη βροτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					722
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				1023
			</span></i> codd.; <i>laborious,</i> Puchstein <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				p.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>painful, toilsome,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					320
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[τόξα]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					777
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰκία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>El.</u>
					515
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάγκαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1011
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοῦσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aff.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρυπτεία π. πρὸς τὰς καρτερήσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					633b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι᾽ ἐμὸν ὄνομα π.</span> (i.e.
			Helen's) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				199
			</span></i> (lyr.). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					63
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phalar.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				34
			</span></i>.</div>
